{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/extras/0ebf50f5edf0344367ecd54aebbd8995.poster.avif?t=1752473600\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/extras/0ebf50f5edf0344367ecd54aebbd8995.webm?t=1752473600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/extras/0ebf50f5edf0344367ecd54aebbd8995.mp4?t=1752473600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must survive in a villa full of anomalies. There are dolls hidden throughout the villa, and there is an altar in the villa yard where you must offer the dolls. Offer a total of 12 dolls to the altar to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoiding the hostile anomalies that are targeting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find 12 dolls and offer them to the altar through 1~4 player play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of four dolls exist in the world at the same time. Dedicating one doll to the altar creates another doll in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry if your companions die, you can revive them by using the interaction key. Of course, if all players die, it's over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/extras/6fc9f82ca0f74cd96b07321af30d72db.poster.avif?t=1752473600\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/extras/6fc9f82ca0f74cd96b07321af30d72db.webm?t=1752473600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/extras/6fc9f82ca0f74cd96b07321af30d72db.mp4?t=1752473600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villa consists of 1~3 floors with several rooms and a rooftop, and you can encounter various anomalies in the villa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/extras/b836dd898a6231750e3a65ecc6d08817.poster.avif?t=1752473600\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/extras/b836dd898a6231750e3a65ecc6d08817.webm?t=1752473600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/extras/b836dd898a6231750e3a65ecc6d08817.mp4?t=1752473600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are anomalies that simply surprise the player, and hostile anomalies that hate the player finding the dolls. If you see a hostile anomaly approaching you, run away with all your might!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3818570/7da3daa8e788256d1f784d7ee66211cdf02199d4.jpg"},{"name":"DICE with EYES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3818570/b6df54a5910600a8607b55c97689a3d82d4c4ac8.jpg"},{"name":"<3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3818570/ccdd67a30c9ad46254c605b7d71deba6cd6a7c71.jpg"},{"name":"Terrible Meal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3818570/06adbbf36db911504ab834240bee7bd7b2af2caa.jpg"},{"name":"LUB-DUB","path