/extras/6fc9f82ca0f74cd96b07321af30d72db.mp4?t=1752473600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villa consists of 1~3 floors with several rooms and a rooftop, and you can encounter various anomalies in the villa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/extras/b836dd898a6231750e3a65ecc6d08817.poster.avif?t=1752473600\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/extras/b836dd898a6231750e3a65ecc6d08817.webm?t=1752473600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/extras/b836dd898a6231750e3a65ecc6d08817.mp4?t=1752473600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are anomalies that simply surprise the player, and hostile anomalies that hate the player finding the dolls. If you see a hostile anomaly approaching you, run away with all your might!</p>","developers":["LOW BORN"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818570/6a70696d98d0d2312afa6c8f45133cb9a767ae46/header.jpg?t=1752473600","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818570/1011321593/c6929cf6185cf104053f050a6037ea750aec6be8/1750366101/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750779933","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818570/1011321593/c6929cf6185cf104053f050a6037ea750aec6be8/1750366101/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750779933","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818570